; Out-of-loop reductions with different kinds of start values. Constant and
; function argument start values are available before the loop. Start values
; defined by instructions, such as a load or an outer loop's phi, may arrive
; late. Loops use VF 4 and IC 1 via metadata unless noted.

; Function argument start value.
define i32 @add_arg_start(ptr %a, i64 %n, i32 %start) {
